<title>UK: Genfinance sets 600 mln Danish crown 9-year bond.</title>
<headline>Genfinance sets 600 mln Danish crown 9-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by lead manager Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENFINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  GENERALE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    600 MLN DKR   COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    23.MAY.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    23.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  BELGIUM   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
